  "description": {
   "en": "*A drug that makes you invisible… A clock that stops time…*\n\nA slapstick, cackling, and… slightly thrilling?... story of the daily life of “Doctor”, a girl who belongs to the Science Department and works day and night on such mysterious, dreamlike inventions, and “Assistant Hara-kun”, who is constantly at her mercy!\n\nThis is a compilation of the comics that were posted on Twitter (X) and pixiv.",
   "ja": "『 透明人間になる薬… 時を止める時計…！』\n\nそんな夢のような怪し〜い発明に日夜 勤しむ「科学部」に所属する女の子『博士』と\nそれに振り回されるお手伝いの『助手原くん』のドタバタ ムフフで…ちょっぴりドキドキ？…な日常劇！\n\n(x)Twitter や pixiv にて掲載していた漫画のまとめになります。\n本編『美術部ガール』のスピンオフ派生作品です。"
  },
